{
  "id": "PRO.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 2",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My son, if thou wilt receive my words, and hide my commandments with thee;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So that thou incline thine ear unto wisdom,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "apply thine heart to understanding;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, if thou criest after knowledge,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "liftest up thy voice for understanding;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If thou seekest her as silver, and searchest for her as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hid treasures;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then shalt thou understand the fear of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and find the knowledge of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "giveth wisdom: out of his mouth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "cometh",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "knowledge and understanding.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He layeth up sound wisdom for the righteous:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "he is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a buckler to them that walk uprightly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He keepeth the paths of judgment, and preserveth the way of his saints.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then shalt thou understand righteousness, and judgment, and equity;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "yea",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", every good path.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ When wisdom entereth into thine heart, and knowledge is pleasant unto thy soul;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Discretion shall preserve thee, understanding shall keep thee:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To deliver thee from the way of the evil",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "man",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", from the man that speaketh froward things;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who leave the paths of uprightness, to walk in the ways of darkness;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who rejoice to do evil,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "delight in the frowardness of the wicked;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whose ways",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "crooked, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "they",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "froward in their paths:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To deliver thee from the strange woman,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "from the stranger",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "flattereth with her words;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Which forsaketh the guide of her youth, and forgetteth the covenant of her God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For her house inclineth unto death, and her paths unto the dead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None that go unto her return again, neither take they hold of the paths of life.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That thou mayest walk in the way of good",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.2.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.2.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and keep the paths of the righteous.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the upright shall dwell in the land, and the perfect shall remain in it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the wicked shall be cut off from the earth, and the transgressors shall be rooted out of it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PRO.3",
    "number": "3",
    "bookId": "PRO"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "PRO.1",
    "number": "1",
    "bookId": "PRO"
  }
}